+
+# Rental service: equipment, quote, book
+
+Added `createRentalService()` in `src/index.ts` (in-memory) with `addEquipment`, `quote` and `book`,
+written test-first (`test/rental.test.ts`, run with `npm test`).
+
+- Totals are integer cents: whole days times the item's daily price.
+- Periods must be UTC ISO strings at midnight, with `end` after `start`; `end` is exclusive.
+- `book` refuses overlapping periods for the same item; adjacent periods are allowed.
+- Cancellation is deliberately not implemented (rule 5 is needed later).
